window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Maggie Fredrickson is just trying to get home to her grandparents, but a broken-down VW and a thunderstorm land her on the doorstep of a haunted mansion. Soaked, stranded, and pulled like a magnet to the grumpy, brooding man who answers the door.</p> <p>Morgan Smithe is a bestselling author, a grieving witch, and not interested in sheltering a powerful stranger who doesn’t realize what she is. But the moment Maggie steps inside his recently inherited mansion, he can sense her magic. And when sparks fly—magical and otherwise—he’s left wondering if she’s a threat… or fate.</p> <p>As Maggie awakens to her true identity, the two are pulled into a world of shadowy power, long-buried secrets, and ancient beings who don’t play fair. Together, they’ll confront the mysterious force behind a string of magical deaths—including the ones that shattered both of their lives.</p> <p>Witchy, kinky, and wildly unfiltered, <i>Halloween Hollow</i> is a high-heat fantasy romance filled with magical chaos, polyamorous ghosts, dark enchantments, and spice levels that break the cauldron.</p> <p>Trigger warnings included. Enter at your own delicious risk.</p> <p>Noted Content Trigger Warnings: Frequent references to grief, polyamory and consensual non-monogamy, LGBTQ sexuality, impact play, consensual bondage with protagonist, physical violence, kidnapping and non-consent with antagonist, DID, reference to childhood sexual abuse.</p>"; 
